<title>PHILIPPINES: MBC sets 3,391.36 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>MBC sets 3,391.36 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila Broadcasting Co said on Thursday its board had approved a 3,391.36 percent stock dividend declaration.</p>
<p>The record date would be fixed by the Securities and Exchange Commission, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The board also approved increasing capital stock to one billion pesos from the present 4.0 million pesos, it said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
